- cilium/cilium (https://github.com/cilium/cilium), Apache-2.0

Third-party map data

The web UI bundles the country outlines of world-atlas (https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas), ISC, derived from Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), public domain, for geomap panels.
